    "turn_text": "Well, they just want to repeal and replace. Then what's interesting is if you ask them what they want to replace it with, it's really interesting to hear because they'll say things like, well, allow insurance companies to go across state lines. And you go like, how does that work? How does an Alabama company an Alabama insurance company, insure you in Minnesota, because most of what insurance does is putting a provider network",
